			description: [
				"The first Rite, and the only one that needs no mana. Put a raw bloom in a Petal Apothecary with two petals and one growing thing, and the water does the rest. Slow, cheap, and available the day you wake up."
				""
				"STATION: petal apothecary"
				"MANA: none"
				"RETURN: 1x per raw bloom"
				""
				"Later Rites do not replace earlier ones. The same raw bloom is valid input to every Rite you have unlocked — they simply pay better. Use whichever you can afford to run."
			]
			icon: "botania:apothecary_livingrock"
